tatus preserved via\\n   php.rt/exit-status through shutdown). Regressions:\\n   :exit-skips-finally, :exit-in-finally-wins.\\n5. P5 unclosed buffers (P1) — FOUND COMPLETE. php/drain-buffers!\\n   folds nested buffers via ob_end_flush after the destructor phase,\\n   before releasing globals. Regression: :unclosed-buffer-drains.\\n\\nNew fixtures carry :oracle :pending via the fx helper default; no\\nfixture pins or oracle text were changed. No P2 scope touched.\\n\\n## Gates (laptop-legal)\\n\\n- clojure -M:test -n yang.php.antlr.safepoint-test: 5 tests,\\n  20 assertions, 0 failures.\\n- clojure -M:test -n yang.php.antlr.request-context-test\\n  -n yang.php.antlr.builtin-surfaces-test: 5 tests, 142 assertions,\\n  0 failures.\\n- clj -M:kondo --lint on safepoint.cljc + prelude.cljc: 0 errors,\\n  0 warnings.\\n- cljstyle: not runnable on this laptop (no cljstyle alias/binary);\\n  not run. No e2e/slow/subsystem suites run (laptop rule).\\n\\n## Escalations\\n\\nNone. No design decision needed round-tripping through the seat.\\n\",\"exit_code\":0,\"status\":\"completed\"}}\n{\"type\":\"item.started\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"item_33\",\"type\":\"command_execution\",\"command\":\"/bin/zsh -lc \\\"/Library/Developer/CommandLineTools/usr/bin/git diff master...HEAD -- src/cljs/datomworld/demo/compilation_pipeline.cljs | tail -60; nl -ba src/cljs/datomworld/demo/compilation_pipeline.cljs | sed -n '188,235p'; nl -ba src/cljc/yin/repl/frontends.cljc | sed -n '45,140p'\\\"\",\"aggregated_output\":\"\",\"exit_code\":null,\"status\":\"in_progress\"}}\n{\"type\":\"item.completed\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"item_33\",\"type\":\"command_execution\",\"command\":\"/bin/zsh -lc \\\"/Library/Developer/CommandLineTools/usr/bin/git diff master...HEAD -- src/cljs/datomworld/demo/compilation_pipeline.cljs | tail -60; nl -ba src/cljs/datomworld/demo/compilation_pipeline.cljs | sed -n '188,235p'; nl -ba src/cljc/yin/repl/frontends.cljc | sed -n '45,140p'\\\"\",\"aggregated_output\":\"+\\n+\\n+(declar