{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_30","type":"agent_message","text":"P9 still has contract defects despite the reported green gate: diff/intersect use loose equality, negative `strrpos` offsets remain wrong, and JSON encoding does not propagate nested failure correctly. The new tests also assert a nonexistent extraction constant. I’m checking the counterexamples against PHP 8.3 source so the required follow-up is concrete."}}
